<title>HUNGARY: TVK plans 8pct '96 dividend vs 7.4pct '95.</title>
<headline>TVK plans 8pct '96 dividend vs 7.4pct '95.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian chemicals company TVK said on Friday it planned to pay an eight percent dividend or 80 forint a share on its 1996 earnings.</p>
<p>TVK paid a 7.4 percent dividend on its 1995 earnings.</p>
<p>TVK will hold its annual shareholders meeting on May 20.</p>
<p>In 1996 TVK posted a consolidated IAS after-tax profit of 7.69 billion forints.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
